/// Converts a Chebyshev‐series coefficient vector `c` into a polynomial
/// coefficient vector `p`, satisfying the following Verus specification:
/// 1. Total: accepts any `c: Vec<i8>` (no preconditions).
/// 2. `p` has the same length as `c`.
/// 3. If `c.len() == 0`, then `p == c`.
